    {"module":"SceneEffects", "required":["BepInEx 5 / Harmony", "TomRender.Core.dll", "KKSAPI (marco.kkapi)", "ExtensibleSaveFormat", "TomSceneEffects.Runtime.dll paired with KKS_TomSceneEffects.dll"], "resources":["Studio native DepthOfField effect; original effect shader resources"], "optional":["KKS_TomBSDF (soft BepInEx dependency)", "StudioMCP (test client only)"], "fallback":"Default Native / scene Inherit. BeforeTransparents is explicit and affects ALL transparent geometry. Guarded native adapter failures restore native scheduling; scene-color routing uses Core protocol 1, not BSDF private IL.", "status":"prototype-local-only"}
